<h3>Multiple Policy Support</h3>

<p>
    You can select multiple policies for a single certificate. When you do:
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Information from all selected policies is included</li>
    <li>Different policy types (General Liability, Workers' Comp, Auto, etc.) are properly organized</li>
    <li>The certificate shows all relevant coverages</li>
</ul>

<p>
    This is useful when a client needs a certificate showing all their policies at once.
</p>

