<h2>Form Types</h2>

<p>
    Quickfire supports various form types:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>ACORD forms</strong> – Standard insurance industry forms</li>
    <li><strong>Certificates of Insurance</strong> – Specialized certificate editor</li>
    <li><strong>Applications</strong> – Policy applications and related forms</li>
    <li><strong>Custom forms</strong> – Other PDF forms you need to fill out</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Each form type works the same way—open, edit, save with version history, and attach or download as needed.
</p>

